    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/3569875536f6ed3abd419fcb83d79a03.poster.avif?t=1721330031\" width=422 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/3569875536f6ed3abd419fcb83d79a03.webm?t=1721330031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/3569875536f6ed3abd419fcb83d79a03.mp4?t=1721330031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Hop into this feral tournament and be a champion in SUPER ANIMAL SOCCER!!<br><br>You can pass, you can shoot, you can tackle, you can PARRY and you can EXPLODE your enemies......I mean, your adversaries.<br><br>Game modes:<br>- World Tur<br>- Tournament<br>- Exhibition<br><br>More description soon....<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/6affe7caa01c0846b2f94497fed63e3d.poster.avif?t=1721330031\" width=422 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/6affe7caa01c0846b2f94497fed63e3d.webm?t=1721330031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/6affe7caa01c0846b2f94497fed63e3d.mp4?t=1721330031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
